{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the bundled "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":" skill so your AI coding assistant has Swidux’s architecture rules and code templates on hand."}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Using the Swidux Agent Skill","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}]},"kind":"article","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/agentskill"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"swidux-ref"},{"type":"text","text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The skill is published in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"text","text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns)."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", reducers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"Installing the skill","anchor":"Install